e Haven Institution, therapy is torture. You're a patient against your will, stripped of identity and injected into an experiment gone violently wrong. Surveillance eyes watch your every move. Resistance is punished. Escape is a myth. The Crimson Insurgency ensures that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room bleeds with the cries of those who came before you. Can you survive long enough to uncover the truth or will you be just another smile on their wall?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509710/extras/a682ac83eebe971e61501293a9f94e54.poster.avif?t=1755889705\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509710/extras/a682ac83eebe971e61501293a9f94e54.webm?t=1755889705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509710/extras/a682ac83eebe971e61501293a9f94e54.mp4?t=1755889705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509710/extras/758243265ab344132e8f349bc38be769.webp?t=1755889705\" data-has-big width=800 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Smile doesn\u2019t rely on cheap jump scares. It breaks you from the inside out. Reality twists. Time fractures. The screams feel like they\u2019re coming from inside your skull thanks to spatial and binaural audio that claws at your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the soft hum of fluorescent lights to the manic whispers in the walls, every sound is engineered to rattle your nerves. Headphones aren't just recommended. They're required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.